/**
@mainpage Python bindings
ID3dev as of version 2026.11 now features python bindings allowing Python users to edit, view, and create ID3v1, ID3v2.2,
ID3v2.3, and Id3v2.4 tags. Moreover, you are required to generate these bindings yourself via the provided wheel.py script
located in the scripts directory. please ensure you have at least python 3.9 installed for cffi and setuptools.

*/